p-0-0" class=3D"wprm-recipe-instruction" style=3D"list-style-type: decimal;=
"><div class=3D"wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style=3D"margin-bottom: 5px;"=
>Before preheating, arrange two oven racks so that two baking sheets will f=
it in your oven. Preheat your oven to 425 degrees F (218 C) and line two st=
andard size baking sheets with parchment paper.</div></li><div id=3D"AdThri=
ve_Recipe_2_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad   adthrive-recipe adthrive-recipe=
