ime I=E2=80=99ll add more cherry tomatoes. I think both their liquid and ac=
idity will help. Also, I cut this recipe in half, and the vegetables and to=
fu turned out crispy and nice. But I think if I=E2=80=99d done the whole re=
cipe, it would=E2=80=99ve steamed more than I=E2=80=99d like.</p>
